        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, you've been waiting for two days, and now we're on the brink of the championship's Round 2\u2014the Triathlon!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "20_I02_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The rules are simple as could be. First you run, then you ride, and finally you swim!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Obstructing competitors? No problem! As long as one of your teammates finishes, you pass!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Shortcuts are fair game, but careful of who's lying within the alleys! They're not gonna roll over and let you through!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Furthermore, if you reach the finish, but the cycling and swimming checkpoints never saw you, then that's not gonna count!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "In other words, contestants, nothing's stopping you from spinning around and diving in at the start line\u2014if you wanna be the laughing stock of the whole city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're someone who's got it made and you wanna hitch on a low-altitude aircraft, sure!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "But, if the audience doesn't like that, you might just get booted out at the votes!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Further, as fifteen teams directly passed Round 1, along with one team being revived thanks to audience voting, sixteen teams in total made it out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Thus, eight teams will pass Round 2.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the first eight teams to make it who get the right to pass!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, then, let's invite those sixteen teams up onto the stage!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
