        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_486_espumo_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahaha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe we should split up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_486_espumo_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Triathlon's extremely long. We'll lose contact fast if we all do our own thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Save for any teams sending lone people off to obstruct others, it's principally as a joint effort.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you two have no opinions along that line, then I suggest we work together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No objections.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's acceptable. So long as you don't hinder me in a fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And the very same to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebgtween",
        "xFrom": -720,
        "xTo": -180,
        "duration": 1,
        "ease": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who knew? I thought I was seeing things when I first saw her on the TV, but Ch'en really is here too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca"
    },
    {
        "text": "On her own vacation, I guess. After the competition's over, let's go say hello to her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_190_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eyjafjalla"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Brilliant. You two can watch, I'll go buy you some food. Stay right here and don't wander off, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_199_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sussurro"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebgtween",
        "xFrom": -180,
        "xTo": -720,
        "duration": 1,
        "ease": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's your introduction to all sixteen teams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like Round 1, you audience-siders get the chance to place your bets here and splash in even more competition joy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "All spectators are invited to register your info on the government site, and you can make yourself a little extra cash!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "For specifics on how it'll work, refer to your government-issued competition guides.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "During Round 2, you'll find our honored guest in a slightly different place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Pancho's already headed for the cruise ship to prepare Round 3, so he'll be talking with you via video feed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, the contestants are all at the ready line! Let's have Lady Candela up for us to fire off the Round 2 salute!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have fun, all you youngsters. I declare\u2014Round 2 has officially begun!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
